        "end": 1300
      },
      "content": "### Costs (Option B)\n| Item | £ |\n|---|---|\n| Licence, hosting and support, five years | 690,000 |\n| Implementation services (call-off) | 235,000 |\n| Contingency (held by Finance, not committed) | 90,000 |\n| **Programme total including contingency** | **1,015,000** |",
