      "locator": {
        "kind": "char-offset",
        "start": 1885,
        "end": 2056
      },
      "content": "Data migration from Orchard is the main risk. Vantry's standard exit terms are weaker than we would like and the Company Secretary has not yet reviewed the draft contract.",
